id: pm-rust-sdk-holder-projection
title: Project legacy holder identity in direct SDK claim refusals
description: Match the GH-1707 legacy holder projection in direct SDK ownership errors. Preserve enrollment of stored credentials for CLI recovery while keeping raw holder data outside the public refusal. Cover item and journal byte stability and compare both CLI formats with the published oracle.
type: Task
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[3]: follow-up,"gh:unbraind/pm-cli#1707",oracle
created_at: "2026-11-18T11:23:58.521Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-18T17:13:26.512Z"
assignee: codex-sol
claim_principal: codex-sol
author: codex-sol
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-18T16:39:29.060Z",codex-sol,Reviewing the assigned PR 181 findings against native behavior and the pinned oracle. Regression tests and gate results will be linked here.
  "2026-11-18T16:52:39.958Z",codex-sol,"PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD-X - Retained oracle parity. Invoking the pinned redactIdentityCredentials on the same public scoped path with no port preserves the identity. Port 8443 produces https://[redacted]@scope/pkg, as does the userinfo plus port control."
  "2026-11-18T17:12:48.481Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65BDBt - 34d1ea82c7af. Validate the effective SDK ownership principal before lock acquisition. The direct and scoped identity cases preserve item and history bytes and create no session.
  "2026-11-18T17:12:51.408Z",codex-sol,"PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD7- - 34d1ea82c7af. Project structured direct-SDK ownership refusals, including nested evidence. The legacy holder regression checks the returned detail and context."
  "2026-11-18T17:13:19.258Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD9u - 34d1ea82c7af. Claim and strict ownership errors construct detail from the projected assignee. The SDK and CLI regressions cover stored credentials and copies in recovery.
  "2026-11-18T17:13:26.512Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTwgMRs65CD-g - 34d1ea82c7af. Reject a credential-bearing options or scoped principal before persistence. Plain and encoded fixtures exercise the SDK with a clean request author.
